# (b plays on near (442,-10) while a is cut: a wander towards (-150,-60) crosses stag0101's rock slope, which a k2
# character does not survive; W7b's b died there in round r2a.)
# W7d, guest b (k2).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
follow 40 until epoch>=@200
wander 442 -10 8 until epoch>=@260 fail stage=stagml11
log b stayed
follow 40 until sealed>=1500 fail stage=stagml11
